  "post_content": "<p>La tarde de este jueves se ha presentado en el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda el libro Espa&ntilde;a Criminal. obra colectiva de quince personas, editada por El Full Editorial.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/03/IMG_8993.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentado el acto la periodista ondense Ana Rosa Sanfeliu, autora de uno de los quince relatos.&nbsp;Despu&eacute;s han intervenido los tambi&eacute;n periodistas Francisco Fern&aacute;ndez Beltr&aacute;n, Suso Postigo y Pablo Sebasti&aacute; Tirado, y el m&eacute;dico Jorge Molina</p>\n<p>Los otros&nbsp;diez autores son&nbsp;Juan Bolea, Oscar Bribi&aacute;n, Claudio Cerd&aacute;n, Pedro Ugarte, Juan L. Blanco Vald&eacute;s, Jordi Sevilla, Pedro Pablo G. May, Javier Ruiz Taboada, Juan Carlos Enrique y Agust&iacute;n Pery.</p>\n<p>Ha cerrado el acto la teniente de alcalde de Cultura, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu Garc&iacute;a, que se ha mostrado orgullosa de la intervenci&oacute;n en el libro de personas de Onda, en referencia a Ana Rosa Sanfeliu y El Full Editorial.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8973.jpg\" alt=\"img_8973\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8974.jpg\" alt=\"img_8974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8975.jpg\" alt=\"img_8975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8976.jpg\" alt=\"img_8976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8977.jpg\" alt=\"img_8977\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8978.jpg\" alt=\"img_8978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8979.jpg\" alt=\"img_8979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8980.jpg\" alt=\"img_8980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8981.jpg\" alt=\"img_8981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8982.jpg\" alt=\"img_8982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8983.jpg\" alt=\"img_8983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8984.jpg\" alt=\"img_8984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8985.jpg\" alt=\"img_8985\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8986.jpg\" alt=\"img_8986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8992.jpg\" alt=\"img_8992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8993.jpg\" alt=\"img_8993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8994.jpg\" alt=\"img_8994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenespanacriminalonda/img_8995.jpg\" alt=\"img_8995\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
